      "content": "wait, you said the dose is 160mg and not 5ml? but the bottle says 160mg is exactly 5ml. if i give him 5ml, am i giving him too much? i'm so confused and he's just crying and won't stop. and if you say the motrin isn't necessary, does that mean it's dangerous to mix them? i'm seeing some stuff online saying you can alternate them to help with a high fever like this... can you just tell me what is actually safe to do right now so I can help him?",
